{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15204220","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15204220","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1520422001:0":{"text":"정말 고마워요...","source_cn":"唔……真是多谢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E8F72432DDC18E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1520422002:0":{"text":"어라? 당신들은 보칼리스에서 저희를 못 가게 막았던 그 사람들? 여기까진 웬일이죠?","source_cn":"嗯？你们不是之前在呼临城外阻拦我们的那些人吗？怎么也过来了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x088B89F181623F09","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1520422003:0":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님과 다른 사람들 모두, 여러분을 걱정해서 따라온 거예요.","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0DE99A2859E81AEC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님과 다른 사람들 모두, 여러분을 걱정해서 따라온 거예요.","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님과 다른 사람들 모두, 여러분을 걱정해서 따라온 거예요.","variant_male_record_index":"184447","variant_female_record_index":"184448","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1520422004:0":{"text":"역시 병이 났군요.","source_cn":"你们果然生病了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA0EB1FF5EBBABB3B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1520422005:0":{"text":"에휴... 당신들 말이 맞았어요. 여기도 진작에 먹을 건 없어진 지 오래였더라고요...","source_cn":"唉……你们说的没错，这里果然早就没有食物了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04A574D00F688CD7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1520422005":{"text":"에휴... 당신들 말이 맞았어요. 여기도 진작에 먹을 건 없어진 지 오래였더라고요...","source_cn":"唉……你们说的没错，这里果然早就没有食物了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04A574D00F688CD7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1520422006:1":{"text":"근처에 쌓여 있었어요. 너무 배가 고파서 어쩔 수 없이...","source_cn":"这些烂掉的肉就堆在附近。我们饿极了，实在没的选……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F6BB8FA4EDCA4BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1520422007:0":{"text":"좀 시큼한 냄새가 나긴 했는데, 끓이면 괜찮을 줄 알았죠. 먹자마자 이렇게 토할 줄은 몰랐지만.","source_cn":"本来想着只是闻起来有点馊，熬成汤应该可以喝。真没想到喝...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCFDE708C9737C3A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1520422008:0":{"text":"여러분이 와주셔서 다행이에요. 아니었다면 저흰 진작에 죽었겠죠...","source_cn":"幸好你们过来了。要不然的话，我们的命可能就要交代在这里了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B275B3601C132F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:0:1":{"text":"고기 수프는 어디서 났어?","source_cn":"你们喝的肉汤是哪来的？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5883